      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's not just wider, it's also different for each hand.\n\nFor example on this picture the left's hand fingers are more apart of each other than the right's hand fingers.\n\n(also the controller models are visible for some reason when I turn on the camera)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
